        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "While Jesus was in Jerusalem during the Passover Festival, many believed in him as they saw the miracles he performed. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But Jesus did not trust himself to them, because he knew them all. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "There was no need for anyone to tell him about them, because he himself knew what was in their hearts.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.25"
            ]
          }
        }
